--- !u!114 &288627990
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 288627985}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 288c7e5f94a322944b5b33fd01ac8949, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  nameMiniGameList:
  - Hungry sharks
  - Color Survival
  - Cambodia Survival
  - Pirate King's Gaze
  - Tile Wars
  - Deadly Four
  - 'Cannon Chaos '
  instructTextList:
  - Use movement keys and quick reflexes to dodge shark attacks.
  - Stand on the platform that matches your target color before time runs out.
  - Dodge laser beams and fire as much as possible.
  - Move while the Pirate King is looking away. Stop immediately when he turns around.
  - Move across the tiles to claim them for your color. Own as many tiles as possible.
  - A bomb will be randomly assigned to one player, move closer to your opponent
    to pass the bomb.
  - Dodge artillery fire and survive on the island, making sure not to fall into
    the water.
  errorTextList:
  - "The shark\u2019s hunting speed will gradually increase with each wave!"
  - The number of surviving colored squares will decrease over time!
  - The difficulty of the lasers will gradually increase over time!
  - Be careful! Pay attention to his voice! He could turn around at any moment!
  - Color Wipe removes color from adjacent tiles. Freeze temporarily stops your movement!
  - The bomb explodes when the countdown reaches 4 seconds, and whoever is holding
    it will be eliminated!
  - The number and firing rate of the cannons will increase over time!
